# Linting & Formatting

## Tools

- **ESLint v10** — `npm run lint` (`eslint --fix 'src/**/*.ts'`), flat config in `eslint.config.ts`
- **Prettier** — `npm run format` (`prettier --write 'src/**/*.ts'`)
- Stack: `@eslint/js` recommended, `typescript-eslint` recommended, `eslint-plugin-prettier/recommended`

Node floor: `^20.19.0 || ^22.13.0 || >=24` (ESLint v10). CI uses Node 22.

## Project-Specific ESLint Overrides

| Scope | Rule |
|-------|------|
| `src/entities/**`, `src/auth/**` | `camelcase: off` — Bling field/header names (`access_token`, `enable-jwt`) |
| `*.spec.ts`, `*.spec.js`, `*.test.ts`, `*.test.js` | `no-undef: off` |
| All files | `space-before-function-paren: off` |
| Global | `@typescript-eslint/no-var-requires: off` |
| Global | `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any: off` — Bling payload mapping and in-memory repository |
| Global | `@typescript-eslint/no-empty-object-type: off` — empty Bling request/response bodies |
| Global | `@typescript-eslint/no-useless-constructor: off` — JWT/opaque clients re-expose `BlingBase`'s protected constructor |
| Global | `@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars` ignores `_` prefix — unused interface args on the in-memory repository |

## Style Aligned with Codebase

- Single quotes for strings.
- Follow Prettier output on save/format.
- 2-space indentation.
- Trailing commas in multiline objects where Prettier adds them.

## Before Committing

Run `npm run lint` and `npm run format` after editing `src/`.

- `.github/workflows/on-commit-test.yaml` — build + `npm test` on every push.
- `.github/workflows/calculate-coverage.yaml` — coverage on `main`.

## Entity Folder Imports

Import entity class from `'../'` in tests (`src/entities/camposCustomizados/__tests__/index.spec.ts`).

Import repository from `'../../../repositories/bling-in-memory.repository'` relative to `__tests__/`.

Match import ordering: external packages first, then project modules, then local fixtures.
